bin/
dist/
*.test
cover.out
.env
.data/
/clustarr/clustarr
.superpowers/

# A bare `go build` of one of ./cmd/* drops its binary in the repo root.
# CLAUDE.md says never to do that (use `make build` -> bin/); this keeps a
# slip from ever reaching a commit.
/clustarr
/manager
/agent
/markers
/transcode
# No /ui: the ui/ package directory holds that name, so `go build ./cmd/ui`
# cannot drop a binary there, and the pattern would hide new ui/ files.
